Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu clothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,been so much later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,anime
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for Japanese anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And why does everything look so huge?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of robot\Nmonkey or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.35,0:01:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.75,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.99,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They made a monkey out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Tristan. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.87,0:01:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Five said they had him in\Nsome kind of a virtual holding area.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to find him before\Nthey take control of his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And then his mind will be\Ntrapped somewhere in cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.59,0:01:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kyla! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:01:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Seto, it's Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:02:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, friendly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Yuge and the rest of the gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's not Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm thinking about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.13,0:02:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kaiba! And Mokuba! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, I knew we'd track\Nyou down, pal! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you kids run along?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Tristan, you phony!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Joey, I think he's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.75,0:02:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've taken over your friend's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that that's over, I\Ncan take care of you! En garde!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.43,0:02:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you need to pay\Nfor what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting too weird. Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.61,0:03:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, it's still his body!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, I've taken something from you,\Nso we're even now. Come back! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late! He's gone! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What now, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kive is after the fake, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So we gotta find out\Nwhere the real one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that robot runt again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust this little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monkey, and how\Ndangerous can he really be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't touch it, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For all we know, this\Nchimp could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just take this guy apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we could unscrew his head\Nand take out his batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you lay a finger on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This little guy risked\Nhis life to save Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.03,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And just look at him. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do me a favor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep that thing out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we gotta get going, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.35,0:04:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Five may have Tristan's body, but\Nhis mind's gotta be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Zippy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I got my eye on you, you\Nrobot formants. Joey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rescue you from these\Ncorporate sleazeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This shouldn't be too tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.27,0:05:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, get out of the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So we meet again, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How quickly we forget our old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can I find Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever want to see that brother of\Nyours again, you'll have to make it past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Nesbitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Noah? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, I've taken Seto's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that, but why\Nhave you taken him? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When I worked for Kaiba Corp, Seto took\Neverything from me, so this is payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.37,0:06:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't part of the deal, Nesbitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You've broken my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.31,0:06:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But, sir, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand the boy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting to take\Nyou down for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till Seto finds out! Seto? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't be rescuing you\Nanytime soon. That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother would never\Nlet anything happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got his hands tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll have to make it past\Nmy associate to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that one of the Big Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea\Nwho you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It took me a minute, but I\Nrecognize your voice, Lector.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's get this duel over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My sentiments exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and choose your deck\Nfrom the Virtual Cards database.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now choose a monster to\Nact as your Deck Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a no-brainer, Lector.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose Lord of Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have already taken\Nthe form of my Deck Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell which monster I've become?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, and quite frankly,\NI don't care, Lecter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because crushing you will be a simple\Ntask, regardless of your Deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't expect any courtesy from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I play one monster in Defense Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place two cards\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Spear Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.77,0:07:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so confident, aren't you, Mr. Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, go ahead and attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:08:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster is in defense mode, so\Nmy life points are well protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Lector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't do your research.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Spear Dragon, attack his face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've attacked Hero's Shadow Scout,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must draw three\Ncards and show them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.77,0:08:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You still lose life points, even though\Nyour monster was in defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to my spear\Ndragon's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, you didn't\Ndo your research. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to discard the two\Nmagic cards you just drew,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to my monster's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My move's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.69,0:08:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time is right, I'll reveal my\Ncrush card, and this duel will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye, you faceless fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I take my turn,\NI'll activate my Trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Solemn wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And since my turn has officially\Nbegun, my life points will increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.05,0:09:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because my Solemn\NWishes track card boosts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,my power by 500 points\Nwith every card I draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it while you can, because\Nyour next turn will be your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'll all pay for\Ntaking my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play a monster in defense mode and\Nplace one card face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He must see that my Spear\NDragon goes into defense mode
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,after it attacks and that\Nit has zero defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So why didn't he attack it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem, Mr. Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'd appreciate\Nit if you'd make your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,move so I can defeat you\Nand take over your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams, I summon Giant Germ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll switch my Spear\NDragon into attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Spear Dragon, destroy\Nhis face-down monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Settles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.35,0:09:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Trap Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mask of Complexity!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:09:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you won't know whose\Nmonster you're attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine or yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, finally a duel worth watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to attack, Mr. Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I doubt you'll be able\Nto see what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Spear Dragon, attack that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take a look and\Nsee what you've chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.97,0:10:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, too bad, Mr. Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've attacked\Nyour own monster, Giant Jer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.51,0:10:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I was aiming\Nfor, you foolish old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to destroy my giant germ so I can\Nactivate my all-powerful crush card trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's destroyed, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the power to destroy traps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know what monster you are, Lecter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:11:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The only monster I know with\Nthe power to destroy trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am Junzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And with a monster this powerful\Nas my Deathmaster, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.51,0:11:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,stand a chance So prepare to\Nlose your body to me Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this\Nmoment for quite some time, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber. For years I stood\Nby and watched you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,rise to power A power\Nthat should have been mine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As your stepfather's right-hand man I not
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Only helped run Kyber\NCorp. I helped raise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did you repay me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,By taking away everything\NI worked so hard to gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I do that, Lecter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was next in line to run the company\Nuntil you forced your way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As of today, your formal\Neducation is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.59,0:11:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to start\Nlearning lessons in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have something to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll be quite pleased with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hobson!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Present Seto with his gift of $10,000,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in life comes at a price,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you think I'm just\Nhanding this money to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,then think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I am lending you this small\Nfortune as a test. A test?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You have exactly one year to return\Nthe money to me. Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must pay me ten\Ntimes that amount next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you pass this test,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you will prove to me you have the business
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,skills necessary to call yourself a Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all explained\Nin your contract, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass and you earn the last name Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.65,0:12:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fail and it's back to\Nthe orphanage. I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a very wise\Ndecision on your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My assistant lector is the\Nonly one allowed to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You have one year to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, turning $10 million into $100\Nmillion in only one year seems impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.21,0:13:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,See, business is just another game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.53,0:13:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there are a hundred\Ncards here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now pretend each card represents\Na piece of a company. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is where it all becomes a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The trick is to own more\Ncards than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can do that, you'll\Ncontrol the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And how many cards do you need to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic number is 51.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else can ever have more cards than\Nyou as long as you own 51 out of 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.93,0:13:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lecter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to spend all $10 million of\Nmy money and buy me 51 % of a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of company, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Any kind, as long as\Nthey value their workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.15,0:13:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I found and purchased\Nthe perfect company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This company is known for treating\Nits employees like family. How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.15,0:14:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your very own company.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it going to make you\Nall the money you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, this company\Ndoesn't make much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is a way that I can use this\Ncompany to get what I need right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.55,0:14:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Force the president to\Nrun the company my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I buy the company\Nback at ten times the price?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't, I'll shut this place\Ndown, leaving all your employees jobless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You are horrible, and you\Nleave me with no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,With my help, you made ten times\Nyour money back in that one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And you got all the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.51,0:14:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my business skills that\Nearned me that money, Lecter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All you did was follow orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.69,0:14:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you were good for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You never once had your own idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have run Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:15:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only could I, but I will, once I\Nescape to the real world in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When my giant germ was destroyed,\Nits special ability was activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to summon another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just delaying your\Neventual destruction, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.71,0:15:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I've assumed the form of Jinzo,\Nall of your trap cards are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.23,0:15:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know as well as I do that no\None wins a duel with monsters alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Lecter, I'll never lose this game to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll lose so much\Nmore than just this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the Onslaught continue. Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I get 500 extra life points each draw\Nthanks to my Solemn Wishes trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll place two\Ncards face down. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Spear Dragon, attack his face\Ndown monster with Cyclone Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid your attack is\Nuseless, because I activate Cyber Jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.55,0:16:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,which destroys every\Nmonster on the field. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It may have cost me a few life points,\Nbut it cost you all of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we draw five cards and\Nsummon any monsters we pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Force Raider and Twin-Headed Behemoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Injection Fairy Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So they both start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.69,0:16:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And since it's my turn again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I gain another 500 life points\Nthanks to my Solemn Wishes trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I activate Watch Tranquilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card equips me\Nwith an electronic device that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,lowers the attack strength\Nof your offensive monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a test run, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:17:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My watch tranquilizer is about to weaken\Nyour Force Raider since it's a level 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,monster it will lose 400 attack points\Nbringing it down to a total of 1500 that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't matter his fairy lily is still\Nweaker than my monster now it's time for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you to experience my fairy lily's special\Nability By giving up 2,000 life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can raise her power by 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough to wipe out your\Nmonster and then serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lily, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.85,0:17:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not all, Mr. Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Semic's Blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows me to take the life
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,points that you just lost\Nand add them to my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.37,0:17:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Reducing your chances\Nof survival even more
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon a monster in defense mode\Nand end my turn. Very well. You'll never
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:18:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Recuperate from the blow I just delivered.\NI've conquered every challenge life
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,has given me This duel will be no\Ndifferent I'll place one monster in defense
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,mode So you thought you'd play it safe\Nby summoning a monster in defense mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.95,0:18:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have other plans\Nfor you, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Life-Absorbing Machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card allows\Nme to reclaim half of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the life points I gave up in my last turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me quite a power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I need extra life points to\Nensure my victory, but it couldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll sacrifice my face-down monster\Nin order to summon my ultimate weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.41,0:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing we found this\Nvirtual pickup truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:18:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it beats walking, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And it should help us to find the...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why'd you stop the truck, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Hugh, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like some kind of rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now deploying communication center.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating Infrared Sighting Beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for pre-programmed target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba Located.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.07,0:19:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Set for Destruction.
